{"ticker":"CEG","updated":"2026-11-27T22:43:28Z","profile":{"longName":"Constellation Energy Corporation","shortName":"Constellation Energy Corporatio","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.constellationenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":15291,"marketCap":83717988352,"trailingPE":19.139872,"forwardPE":17.767424,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.444321,"pegRatio":0.62,"targetMeanPrice":339.68,"targetHighPrice":399.0,"targetLowPrice":240.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.454,"earningsGrowth":0.745,"grossMargins":0.25241,"operatingMargins":0.17944999,"profitMargins":0.12759,"totalRevenue":34250000384,"beta":1.127,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":380.78,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":228.63,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.73},"summary":"Constellation Energy Corporation produces and sells energy products and services in the United States. The company operates through five segments: Mid-Atlantic, Midwest, New York, ERCOT, and Other Power Regions. It offers electricity, natural gas, energy-related products, and sustainable solutions. The company has approximately 31,676 megawatts of generating capacity consisting of nuclear, wind, solar, natural gas, and hydroelectric assets. It serves distribution utilities, municipalities, cooperatives, and commercial, industrial, public sector, and residential customers. The company was incorporated in 2021 and is headquartered in Baltimore, Maryland.","summary_zh":"星座能源公司在美國生產和銷售能源產品和服務。該公司透過五個部門運作：中大西洋部門、中西部部門、紐約部門、ERCOT 部門和其他電力區域部門。它提供電力、天然氣、能源相關產品和永續解決方案。該公司擁有約 31,676 兆瓦的發電能力，包括核能、風能、太陽能、天然氣和水力發電資產。它為配電公用事業、市政當局、合作社以及商業、工業、公共部門和住宅客戶提供服務。該公司成立於 2021 年，總部位於馬裡蘭州巴爾的摩。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 獨立電力生產商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":334.9,"h":340.545,"l":322.56,"c":334.265,"v":2286700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":334.92,"h":336.78,"l":327.21,"c":329.07,"v":2159600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":326.