TRnTXhnRGRZeFhFOU51UDRJN2c?oc=5","date":"2026-11-24","zh":"星座能源股票的下跌是便宜貨還是警告？"},{"title":"3 Reasons Why Constellation Energy Corporation (CEG) Is a Great Growth Stock","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOTENGZ09mQWJ3YjNPcWdYRDVKTENsZ1RPTTJDWVIydU5CdHczenI2ZTdUX0g1WG5ma253MEVvRldNbXlLVFhZSkxtcWRrblIyZHRoaHFDQzE0TU9oVVVZRm9aMzVfZlhJSmZwdHhBZTM2dTFMcUZ6cFRUd0tkZ1lMUWduZHdHSnFwYncwV1lJR1VzMUJJZEs4OEVMMkFPSjVE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-24","zh":"Constellation Energy Corporation (CEG) 已成為高成長股的 3 個原因"}],"order_news":[{"title":"Nvidia's Huang Returns as CEO, Igniting Rally in AI Power and Grid Stocks","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE4yQTEtRzhLVXJmN2REdmJIdE1EaGtQeFdleHZQR1ZRSHlrTDZvYUliQ2lxY1NPLW5Zc09ZTTVwdnp4SnBka3gwRmV4M2ZIc2l2TFR2MjNQWnJjV3dSSHpqWTFnQWQtQ2FpUXNzU280dE9UVkhiemc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-23","zh":"輝達黃仁勳重新出任首席執行官，引發人工智慧電力和電網股上漲"},{"title":"CEG Q3 FY2026 earnings call","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE85Y2NKcGZyV2JVdEQwVV9iSWJpSHc1SDJXZ0xEWDJMV2lmYU4wUGhyX25sT2ozMVlhNm1TRTNWdlA1NXotaTQ4MXhjb0s0U3Y2cnEydHduU3VhUGhpTUdwaFFVVDUtSDBkTVlCanF4eWdoR3N6a2c?oc=5","date":"2026-11-08","zh":"CEG 2026 財年第三季財報電話會議"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":10},{"name":"併購","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1868275/000186827526000032/ceg-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"On February 21, 2021, the Board of Directors of Exelon authorized management to pursue a plan to separate its competitive generation and customer-facing energy businesses, conducted through Constellation and its subsidiaries, into an independent, publicly traded company. CEG Parent, a Pennsylvania corporation and a direct, wholly owned subsidiary of Exelon, was newly formed for the purpose of separation and had not engaged in any activities except in preparation for the distribution. On February 1, 2022, Exelon completed the separation by distributing all the outstanding shares of the Company's common stock, on a pro rata basis to the holders of Exelon's common stock, with the Company holding all the interests in Constellation previously held by Exelon (the \"Separation\"). As of 2002, Constellation has been an individual registrant concurrent with the registration of its public debt under","zh":"2021 年 2 月 21 日，Exelon 董事會授權管理層實施一項計劃，將透過 Constellation 及其子公司開展的競爭性發電和麵向客戶的能源業務拆分為獨立的上市公司。 CEG Parent 是一家賓州公司，是 Exelon 的直接全資子公司，是為了分拆而新成立的，除了準備分配外，沒有從事任何活動。 2022年2月1日，Exelon完成了分拆，將公司所有已發行普通股按比例分配給Exelon普通股股東，公司持有Exelon先前持有的Constellation所有權益（「分拆」）。自 2002 年起，Constellation 已成為個人登記人，同時根據《公共債務登記法》登記其公共債務。"},{"en":"Unless otherwise indicated or the context otherwise requires, references herein to the terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us\" and \"the Company\" refer collectively to CEG Parent and Constellation. See Glossary for defined terms.","zh":"除非另有說明或上下文另有要求，否則本文中提及的術語「我們」、「我們的」、「我們」和「公司」統指 CEG 母公司和 Constellation。有关术语的定义，请参阅术语表。"},{"en":"On January 7, 2026, Constellation acquired all of the outstanding equity interests of Calpine in a cash and stock transaction. Unless otherwise noted, information in this Form 10-K excludes Calpine. For further information regarding the transaction, refer to Note 2 — Mergers, Acquisitions, and Dispositions of the Combined Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements.","zh":"2026年1月7日，Constellation透過現金加股票交易收購了Calpine的全部已發行股權。除非另有說明，本表 10-K 中的資訊不包括 Calpine。有關該交易的更多資訊，請參閱附註 2 — 合併、收購和合併財務報表合併附註的處置。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Based on data from EEI, we are the nation's largest energy supplier for C&I and residential power volumes. Through our integrated business operations, we sell electricity, natural gas, and other energy-related products and sustainable solutions to various types of customers, including distribution utilities, municipalities, cooperatives, and commercial, industrial, public sector, and residential customers in markets across multiple geographic regions. We serve approximately 2 million total customer accounts, including three-fourths of Fortune 100 companies, and approximately 1.4 million residential customers.","zh":"根據 EEI 的數據，我們是全國最大的工商業和住宅用電量能源供應商。透過我們的綜合業務運營，我們向各種類型的客戶銷售電力、天然氣和其他能源相關產品和永續解決方案，包括多個地理區域市場的配電公用事業、市政當局、合作社以及商業、工業、公共部門和住宅客戶。我們為約 200 萬個客戶帳戶提供服務，其中包括四分之三的財富 100 強公司，以及約 140 萬個住宅客戶。"},{"en":"We are a leader in electric power supply, serving approximately 204 TWhs in 2025 through sales to retail customers and wholesale load auctions to a geographically diverse customer base. The following table illustrates these volumes across our five reportable segments:","zh":"我們是電力供應領域的領導者，透過向零售客戶銷售和向不同地理位置的客戶群進行批發負載拍賣，到 2025 年提供約 204 太瓦時的電力。下表說明了我們五個可報告部門的這些銷售量："}],"customers":[{"en":"Following the merger with Calpine in January 2026, we are the largest private-sector power producer in the world and the nation's largest producer of clean and reliable energy. With 55 GWs of capacity from nuclear, natural gas, geothermal, hydro, wind and solar facilities, our fleet has the generating capacity to power the equivalent of 27 million homes, providing about 10% of the nation's clean energy and delivering the around-the-clock reliability needed to power America's growing economy. We are also the largest nuclear energy company in the U.S. and a leading competitive retail supplier, serving approximately 2.5 million customer accounts nationwide, including three-fourths of the Fortune 100. We are committed to investing in innovation and new technologies to drive the transition to a reliable, sustainable and secure energy future.","zh":"2026 年 1 月與 Calpine 合併後，我們成為世界上最大的私人電力生產商，也是美國最大的清潔可靠能源生產商。我們的機組擁有 55 吉瓦的核能、天然氣、地熱能、水力、風能和太陽能設施，發電量相當於 2,700 萬戶家庭，提供全國約 10% 的清潔能源，並提供為美國不斷增長的經濟提供動力所需的全天候可靠性。我們也是美國最大的核能公司和領先的有競爭力的零售供應商，為全國約 250 萬個客戶客戶提供服務，其中包括財富 100 強企業中的四分之三。我們致力於投資創新和新技術，以推動可靠、永續和安全的能源未來過渡。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Constellation Mid Atlantic","val":6487000000,"zh":"大西洋中部星座"},{"name":"Constellation Midwest","val":5804000000,"zh":"星座中西部"},{"name":"Constellation Other Regions","val":5583000000,"zh":"星座 其他地區"},{"name":"Constellation New York","val":2389000000,"zh":"紐約星座酒店"},{"name":"Constellation ERCOT","val":1904000000,"zh":"星座ERCOT"}],"total":25533000000}},"peers":["VST","OKLO","GEV","VRT","SMR"]}}